ly unreachable areas with Metroidvania-style progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290690/extras/b8a79f3918e2458de0b2b699d0442127.poster.avif?t=1768494424\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290690/extras/b8a79f3918e2458de0b2b699d0442127.webm?t=1768494424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290690/extras/b8a79f3918e2458de0b2b699d0442127.mp4?t=1768494424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Cyanide Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290690/7f719b3216ba49b106aa644b57141cf40083d4e8/header_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1768494424","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a92026 Nacon. Styx: Blades of Greed \u00a92026 Published by Nacon and developed by Cyanide Studio. All rights reserved.<br />\r\n","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3290690/2094248278/3775a6a2188b81801452a369b5b6fbfbbb403772/1768300826/dash_av1.mpd?t=1768316445","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3290690/2094248278/3775a6a2188b81801452a369b5b6fbfbbb403772/1768300826/dash_h264.mpd?t=1768316445","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3290690/2094248278/3775a6a218